| `NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY` | Client | Alias exposed to browser via Next.js |
| `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET` | Server | Webhook signing secret (starts with `whsec_`) |

